Load nufftax directly; build the streamed kernel by type-1 NUFFT

Collection failed on autoarray releases without the private
`inversion_interferometer_util._load_nufftax`. nufftax is now imported
directly, and the fast path's w-tilde kernels (image and point grids) are
one type-1 NUFFT each (`streaming.kernel_image`) rather than autoarray's
builder with `method="nufft"`, so the fast path depends only on nufftax.
Matches autoarray's kernel to 1e-12, including its zeroed +-N lag.

